  "description": "VOODOO NANTAI 24”\n\nThe Nantai is specially designed for 8-11 year old kids, but it isn’t just a kids mountain bike. Every aspect of the design is thought out and many of its features are derived from Voodoo’s award-winning range of adult bikes, providing your kid with everything they need to develop their riding skills.\n\nNantai’s frame is built around a modern MTB geometry with a slack head angle, perfect for providing kids with a confident and stable handling over any kind of terrain. The aluminium alloy material keeps the weight down to help them maneuver the bike and to be able to pick it up by themselves. We know the latter will happen a lot, so the frame is robust enough to handle any knocks your kid will surely inflict on it.\n\nThe Shimano 1x drivetrain is perfect for young riders, who are still learning how to use gears, while it offers enough range to tackle some serious climbs. Disc brakes, suspension fork, and wide 24” MTB tires complete a real MTB for kids. A bike that will allow them to challenge the pace of their adult companions and friends.\n\nA real MTB for 8-11 year old kids.",
